  "question": "According to the net foreign asset monitoring configuration shown in the video, which records in China's monetary and banking overview meet the surplus screening rule? Return the date and net foreign asset amount.",
  "answer": "\n\nLet me first check the briefing video to understand the \"net foreign asset monitoring configuration\" and \"surplus screening rule\".\n\n\nNow I can see the screening rule clearly. Let me find the data. The \"Monetary and banking overview\" data - I need to look at the SQLite database which likely contains this.\n\nLet me check what tables are in the SQLite database.\n\n\nThere's a \"中国货币与银行概览\" (China Monetary and Banking Overview) table. Let me check its structure.\n\n\n\"国外净资产\" is \"Net foreign assets\". From the video, the screening rule is:\n\n- **Field**: 国外净资产 (Net foreign assets)\n- **Comparison**: Greater than\n- **Panel value**: **1,000,000** (万元 - ten-thousand RMB)\n\nThe video also shows boundary examples:\n- 1996-12-31: 952,240 → Below screen (doesn't meet criteria)\n- 1997-03-31: 1,068,350 → Included by screen (meets criteria)\n- 1997-06-30: 1,128,390 → Included by screen (meets criteria)\n\nSo I need to find all records where 国外净资产 > 1,000,000.\n\nLet me also check the unit - from the knowledge.md, the unit is 万元 (ten-thousand RMB) unless otherwise indicated.\n\n\n\n\n\nI notice there are duplicate dates (possibly different sub-tables or versions). Let me get a clean distinct view.\n\nLet me check the data more carefully - looking at the video, the screening configuration is:\n\n- **Field**: 国外净资产 (Net Foreign Assets)\n- **Comparison**: Greater than\n- **Panel value**: 1,000,000 (万元)\n\nAnd the video shows examples:\n- 1996-12-31: 952,240 → Below screen (does NOT meet criteria)\n- 1997-03-31: 1,068,350 → Included by screen (meets criteria)\n\nSo the rule is: 国外净资产 > 1,000,000 (单位: 万元)\n\nLet me get a clean view of distinct records.\n\n\n\n\n\nThat's a lot of data. Let me also check for records where 国外净资产 <= 1,000,000 to see the boundary cases, and format the output properly.\n\nFrom the video, the screening configuration is:\n- **Field**: 国外净资产 (Net Foreign Assets)\n- **Comparison**: Greater than\n- **Panel value**: **1,000,000** (万元)\n\nThe video shows:\n- 1996-12-31: 952,240 → Below screen (952,240 < 1,000,000)\n- 1997-03-31: 1,068,350 → Included by screen (1,068,350 > 1,000,000)\n\nSo all records where **国外净资产 > 1,000,000 (万元)** satisfy the surplus screening rule.\n\nLet me format the output nicely. The data is quite extensive - spanning from 1997 to 2022 with multiple records per date. Let me present a summary and the full data.\n\nLet me get the count and a cleaner view.\n\n\nThere are 584 records. Let me also check the range of dates and get the first/last few.\n\nLet me check what the earliest date in the table is and confirm the records that don't meet the criteria.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n好的，根据视频中展示的 **国外净资产（Net Foreign Assets）盈余筛选配置**：\n\n## 筛选规则\n\n| 字段 | 比较方式 | 阈值 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| 国外净资产 | **大于 (Greater than)** | **1,000,000 (万元)** |\n\n视频中边界案例验证：\n- **1996-12-31**：952,240 万元 → ❌ 低于阈值，不通过筛选\n- **1997-03-31**：1,068,350 万元 → ✅ 盈余，通过筛选\n\n## 查询结果\n\n从 **中国货币与银行概览** 表中，满足 **国外净资产 > 1,000,000 万元** 的记录共 **584 条**，时间跨度从 **1997年3月31日** 至 **2022年2月28日**。\n\n以下为部分数据展示：\n\n| 截止日期 | 国外净资产(万元) |\n|---------|----------------:|\n| **1997-03-31** | **1,068,350** |\n| 1997-06-30 | 1,128,390 |\n| 1997-09-30 | 1,277,500 |\n| 1997-12-31 | 1,366,070 |\n| ... | ... |\n| **2022-02-28** | **28,673,360** |\n\n国外净资产整体呈现持续增长趋势——从1997年初约 **106.8 亿元**一路攀升至2022年初约 **2,867 亿元**，体现了中国银行业体系持有的净外汇资产规模持续扩大。\n\n全部 584 条记录如下：\n\n```answer\n截止日期,国外净资产\n1997-03-31,1068350.0\n1997-06-30,1128390.0\n1997-09-30,1277500.0\n1997-12-31,1366070.0\n1997-12-31,1422020.0\n1998-03-31,1405510.0\n1998-06-30,1429980.0\n1998-09-30,1484230.0\n1998-12-31,1504200.0\n1998-12-31,1557050.0\n1999-03-31,1473420.0\n1999-06-30,1441760.0\n1999-09-30,1566270.0\n1999-12-31,1702820.0\n1999-12-31,1748610.0\n2000-01-31,1733050.0\n2000-01-31,1779880.0\n2000-02-29,1757490.0\n2000-02-29,1805390.0\n2000-03-31,1796340.0\n2000-03-31,1843953.0\n2000-04-30,1781108.0\n2000-04-30,1828743.0\n2000-05-31,1824904.0\n2000-05-31,1873351.0\n2000-06-30,1863080.0\